stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> tests_pass
    tests_pass --> clippy_clean
    clippy_clean --> fmt_clean
    fmt_clean --> docs_updated
    docs_updated --> no_todos
    no_todos --> no_secrets
    no_secrets --> [*]

    tests_pass   : Did `cargo test` pass with no failures?
    clippy_clean : Is `cargo clippy` free of warnings?
    fmt_clean    : Does `cargo fmt --check` pass?
    docs_updated : Did you update docs for any changed public API?
    no_todos     : Are there no leftover TODO / FIXME / unimplemented!() markers?
    no_secrets   : Did you check for hardcoded secrets or credentials?
